lue that is not [ToString] (a\nvisualization like [Show/MD]) is still printable, but only [ToString] values are compared\nagainst a print/result golden.\n\nA [/Data/Maybe] of something showable is showable, which is what lets an answer of\n[calendarDay] be evaluated at all: a tree is built toward a class, and a tree built toward a\nvalue's own type comes back as the unevaluated application of it.\nSaid here rather than in @stack/core/maybe.ct@, where it would read as the more general truth\nit is. That file does not reach the webdocs, and having it reach them would put it in the\nSCC that @compile.ct@ and @webdoc.ct@ are in, which is a cost paid by every compile for the\nsake of one caller. It moves there when there is a second one.\n\nA task is shown in the webdocs as the task it is, rather than as the declaration it was read\ninto: a box to check and the writing beside it. It is the value itself that is shown, with no\ndisplay type standing in for it, which is what lets checking the box in a doc server write the\nchange back to the note the task was read from."], "/Catln/Doc/DShowCall": [false, {"ptArgMode": {"ptArgLb": true, "ptArgUb": true}, "ptArgs": [], "ptName": "/Catln/Doc/DShowCall", "ptPreds": {"paPreds": [], "tag": "PredsAnd"}, "ptVars": []}, [{"tag": "UnionType", "utConsts": [], "utLeafs": {"/Data/Functor/fmap": [[[], [[{"pkArgs": [{"pkArgs": [], "pkName": "/v", "pkVars": []}], "pkName": "/fn", "pkVars": []}, {"tag": "UnionType", "utConsts": [], "utLeafs": {}, "utTop": [{"paPreds": [], "tag": "PredsAnd"}, {}, []]}], [{"pkArgs": [], "pkName": "/lst", "pkVars": []}, {"tag": "UnionType", "utConsts": [], "utLeafs": {}, "utTop": [{"poPred": {"pcType": {"ptArgMode": {"ptArgLb": true, "ptArgUb": true}, "ptArgs": [], "ptName": "/Data/List/ConsList", "ptPreds": {"paPreds": [], "tag": "PredsAnd"}, "ptVars": [[{"pkArgs": [], "pkName": "/T", "pkVars": []}, {"tag": "UnionType", "utConsts": [], "utLeafs": {}, "utTop": [{"poPred": {"pcType": {"ptArgMode": {"ptArgLb": t